(SoundScope-AI is a multimodal music intelligence platform uniting Digital Signal Processing \(DSP\), Natural Language Processing \(NLP\), and multi-agent AI to provide actionable acoustic and lyrical feedback for audio creators.) Tj
0 -13.872 Td
() Tj
0 -13.872 Td
(1. Datasets: Free Music Archive \(FMA, 106k tracks\) and GTZAN for acoustic benchmarking; Spotify/Genius lyrics paired with OpenAI Whisper for automatic lyric transcription.) Tj
0 -13.872 Td
(2. Analysis & Pipeline:) Tj
0 -13.872 Td
(- DSP: 20-band MFCCs, spectral centroid/flux/rolloff, harmonic-percussive separation \(HPSS\), and tempo/chroma analysis.) Tj
0 -13.872 Td
(- NLP: Lyric transcription, emotion valence-arousal trajectories, rhyme density, and BERTopic thematic modeling.) Tj
0 -13.872 Td
(- ML & Synthesis: Genre/mood classification \(XGBoost/CNN\), UMAP 3D cluster manifold mapping, and a LangGraph multi-agent LLM \(Qwen2.5/Llama-3\) delivering structured production critiques.) Tj
